{
  "name": "Multi-Format Accounts Payable & Invoice Extraction Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. INGESTION\nWatches two sources at once: a Gmail inbox for vendor bill emails (with attachments) and a Google Drive 'Inbound Invoices' folder for uploaded receipts. Both are downloaded as binary and merged into one stream.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "5268aa4c-363c-4dc8-98e2-9ef988b876cf",
      "name": "Note: ## 1. INGESTION\nWatc",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1936,
        128
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. FILE TYPE GATE\nOnly PDFs and images (jpg/png/heic scans) proceed. Anything else is logged and skipped rather than sent to the vision model.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "39df9e47-f4f5-4ff2-b396-2f52501fcfbb",
      "name": "Note: ## 2. FILE TYPE GATE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1296,
        208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. AI VISION EXTRACTION\nRouted by file type to native Anthropic nodes: the 'document' resource handles PDFs, the 'image' resource handles jpg/png/heic scans. Both use a strict JSON-only extraction schema: vendor, invoice #, dates, tax ID, line items, subtotal, tax, grand total. Results are merged back into a single stream before validation.",
        "height": 704,
        "width": 432,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "dd1d22aa-47e4-4313-a6a7-4f1bf191a7b1",
      "name": "Note: ## 3. AI VISION EXTR",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -832,
        -32
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. VALIDATION LOGIC\nA Code node recalculates the line-item sum and compares it to the parsed grand total (with a small rounding tolerance), and checks that required fields like Tax ID aren't missing. This is the fork: clean data flows straight through, anything questionable goes to a human.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 580,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "7fde0e8e-1eb1-4cc8-a777-06ec9b45c12b",
      "name": "Note: ## 4. VALIDATION LOG",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -368,
        96
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5A. CLEAN PATH\nFile is renamed to Vendor_InvoiceNumber_Date.pdf and moved to /Processed. Header row + one row per line item are appended to the accounting sheet. A low-noise Slack ping confirms it.",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 904,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d2792957-19fe-437e-84e6-a89acfc5347f",
      "name": "Note: ## 5A. CLEAN PATH\nFi",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
